<title>RUSSIA: Russian Mosenergo rises over 11 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian Mosenergo rises over 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Moscow regional utility Mosenergo had risen over 11 percent to $1.63, a record high, by 1200 GMT on Tuesday from $1.46 at the close on Monday, when the Russian Trading System index set a record high.</p>
<p>Mosenergo is widely used as a proxy for the Russian market, which has been in an almost non-stop bull run since Christmas. It was the most traded stock by number of moves on Tuesday.</p>
<p>--Peter Henderson, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
